COMPILATION OF: E49B1

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E49B1

   1 a 0000 E49B1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-49/P2] a FIXED member compared with ANOTHER FIXED member,
   4 a 0006      equal extents, QUALIFIED both sides.  [C330] s3 and [C333] s3
   5 a 0006      name member-vs-member as NO OBJECT; E49A1 staged its member-
   6 a 0006      left cell through EB and E48E7 loaded its member-right cell
   7 a 0006      straight into HL, so the recorded laws CANNOT predict this
   8 a 0006      head -- Form S `21 *D(nb) / 11 *D(na)' versus Form M `21
   9 a 0006      *D(na) / EB / 21 *D(nb)' both end HL on the right ([C191]).
  10 a 0006      EB here or not is the measured answer. */
  11 c 0006   dcl
  12 c 0006     1 rec,
  13 c 0006       2 na char(3),
  14 c 0006       2 nb char(3),
  15 c 0006       2 s2 char(2);
  16 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
  17 c 0006   if rec.na = rec.nb then k = 1;
  18 c 001D   put list('K=', k);
  19 c 003F   stop;
  20 a 0042 end E49B1;

CODE SIZE = 0042
DATA AREA = 000C
FREE SYMS = 3888
END  COMPILATION
